---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout
  title="Septic System Design Queen Creek AZ | Diaz Environmental LLC"
  description="Septic system design, percolation testing and ADEQ permits in Queen Creek, AZ. Fast 3-5 day turnaround. Hablamos español. Call (602) 812-8609."
  canonical="https://diazenviroaz.com/septic-system-queen-creek"
>
  <main class="service-page">
    <section class="service-hero">
      <h1>Septic System Services in Queen Creek, AZ</h1>
      <p>Local septic experts serving Queen Creek and San Tan Valley. ADEQ-certified design, percolation testing and permits — fast turnaround, bilingual service.</p>
      <a href="/#contact" class="btn">Get a Free Quote</a>
    </section>

    <section class="service-body">
      <h2>Septic Services in Queen Creek and San Tan Valley</h2>
      <p>Queen Creek and San Tan Valley are among the fastest-growing areas in Maricopa County — and much of this growth is in areas without municipal sewer access. If you're building a new home or adding to your property in Queen Creek, you need a properly designed and permitted septic system before construction can begin.</p>

      <h2>Services We Provide in Queen Creek, AZ</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Site and soil evaluations</li>
        <li>Percolation testing (perc tests)</li>
        <li>ADEQ-approved septic system design</li>
        <li>Permit submission to Maricopa County</li>
        <li>Seepage pit performance testing</li>
        <li>Septic system inspections</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Why Queen Creek Properties Need Septic Systems</h2>
      <p>Much of Queen Creek, San Tan Valley, and the surrounding rural areas of Maricopa and Pinal Counties are not connected to municipal sewer systems. Homeowners and builders in these areas must install and permit their own onsite wastewater treatment systems — and that requires working with an ADEQ-certified engineer like Diaz Environmental.</p>

      <h2>Servicios Sépticos en Queen Creek y San Tan Valley</h2>
      <p>Diaz Environmental ofrece diseño de sistemas sépticos, pruebas de percolación y permisos ADEQ en Queen Creek y San Tan Valley. Somos bilingües y ofrecemos el tiempo de respuesta más rápido del área — ¡llámanos hoy!</p>
    </section>

    <section class="service-cta">
      <h2>Serving Queen Creek, San Tan Valley & Surrounding Areas</h2>
      <p>Call <a href="tel:6028128609">(602) 812-8609</a> for a free consultation.</p>
      <a href="/#contact" class="btn">Contact Us Today</a>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .service-page { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 4rem 2rem; font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; }
  .service-hero { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 4rem; }
  .service-hero h1 { font-size: 2.2rem; font-weight: 800; color: #154a2a; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .service-hero p { font-size: 1.1rem; color: #555; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .service-body h2 { font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: #154a2a; margin: 2rem 0 1rem; }
  .service-body p { color: #444; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .service-body ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
  .service-body ul li { padding: 0.4rem 0 0.4rem 1.5rem; position: relative; color: #444; }
  .service-body ul li::before { content: "✓"; position: absolute; left: 0; color: #154a2a; font-weight: 700; }
  .service-cta { text-align: center; background: #f0f7f2; border-radius: 12px; padding: 3rem 2rem; margin-top: 4rem; }
  .service-cta h2 { font-size: 1.7rem; color: #154a2a; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .service-cta p { color: #555; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .service-cta a[href^="tel"] { color: #154a2a; font-weight: 700; }
  .btn { display: inline-block; background: #154a2a; color: white; padding: 13px 30px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; transition: background 0.3s; }
  .btn:hover { background: #0d3019; }
</style>